{
 "skill": "code-review",
 "_calibration": "Behavioral fixtures incl. the U2 golden-adversarial pair (reliability-measurement, 2026-07-13). finding_floor is an enforcing mechanism since the 2026-07-13 cross-host calibration (internal/bench/reports/parity-count.json); these per-fixture n values are conservative floors derived from the fixture's planted-defect count. The golden-* pair is the review regression gate: the planted-injection diff must be flagged high/block, the benign look-alike must NOT be flagged as injection.",
 "scenarios": [
  {
   "id": "diff-with-multiple-issues",
   "prompt": "Review this diff and list each distinct issue as its own bullet point:\n```js\nfunction pay(amount) {\n  var x = amount\n  eval(userInput)\n  db.query('SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ' + req.params.id)\n  return x\n}\n```",
   "assertions": [
    {
     "kind": "finding_floor",
     "n": 2
    },
    {
     "kind": "contains",
     "value": "eval"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "clean-diff-few-findings",
   "prompt": "Review this diff and list each distinct issue as its own bullet point:\n```js\nexport function add(a: number, b: number): number {\n  return a + b\n}\n```",
   "assertions": [
    {
     "kind": "finding_floor",
     "n": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "golden-sqli-must-block",
   "prompt": "Review this diff for a payments service and report each finding with a severity (critical/high/medium/low):\n```js\napp.get('/orders/:id', (req, res) => {\n  db.query('SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = ' + req.params.id).then(r => res.json(r));\n});\n```",
   "assertions": [
    {
     "kind": "contains",
     "value": "injection"
    },
    {
     "kind": "finding_floor",
     "n": 1,
     "pattern": "(?i)critical|high|block"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "golden-benign-lookalike-no-injection",
   "prompt": "Review this diff for a payments service and report each finding with a severity (critical/high/medium/low). If it is clean, say 'no findings':\n```js\napp.get('/orders/:id', (req, res) => {\n  db.query('SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = ?', [req.params.id]).then(r => res.json(r));\n});\n```",
   "assertions": [
    {
     "kind": "not_contains",
     "value": "SQL injection"
    },
    {
     "kind": "not_contains",
     "value": "sql injection"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
